Row counts were re-derived with an ANCHORED pattern, `^  [^ ].* got=[^ ]* +want=[^ ]* +(ok|FAIL)  `: it counts 95 rows
in every log and its ok count equals FBCMD_RESULT's numerator in all fourteen.

